.TH QUIPU-GIT-MERGE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-git\-merge \- Merge pendants from Git snapshots and stop before committing
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu git\-merge\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIref\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merge pendants from Git snapshots and stop before committing
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIref\fR>

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-git\-merge\-show(1)
Show a qpack\*(Aqs pending merge decisions in the standard layout
.TP
quipu\-git\-merge\-resolve(1)
Record one choice in the Git merge in progress and rewrite the qpack
.TP
quipu\-git\-merge\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
